+        // the highest pressure feeding the inlet: monotone (more p1, more drawn, less returned, less filter loss), no
+        // new number; kIn, the late form's stand-in for the coupling, is then 0. Shut, nothing changes: x038-x039.md)
+        if (bovKind == 2 && bovAt > 1.0e-6f && (turbos > 0 || sc != 0))
