+TEST_CASE("calibration boost: a recirculating blow-off returning more than its blower draws stays finite (X-039)",
+          "[calibration][boost]")
+{
+    // Card X's X-039: a 50 cc single with a 4 L Roots, 0.5 L of charge pipes and a recirculating blow-off went
+    // non-finite 0.54 s into its crank. The blow-off, wide open, returned more than the blower drew; the filter's flow
+    // reversed and the inlet's pressure, taken a sample late, flipped between its floor and a megapascal. With it solved
+    // in the sample (machine.fm chargeSide, the lead's cure (a)) it holds for 10 s of the crank and the running after
